    <briefdescription>
<para>Miss distance and combined position uncertainty in the rotated encounter frame. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The rotated encounter frame is the encounter frame rotated about its z-axis, so that its x-axis and y-axis are along the principal axes of the combined position covariance projected onto the encounter plane (see computeRotatedEncounterFrameParameters). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
